🏢 Production-Level Alternative (Better)
Instead of editing YAML with sed, you can:

kubectl set image deployment/task-tracking \
  task-tracking=rgradison/task-tracking:${{ github.sha }}

🔥 Enterprise-Level (Best Practice)

Use Helm instead of raw YAML:
helm upgrade --install task-tracking ./helm-chart \
  --set image.tag=${{ github.sha }}

kubectl apply -f configmap.yaml
kubectl apply -f secret.yaml
kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml
kubectl apply -f service.yaml
kubectl apply -f hpa.yaml